00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 8.13 · Marketing & Communications
Measuring communications performance

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Reach and likes are easy to count, but what matters is whether people take the action you need.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Link each objective to one or two outcome measures.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Ask “How did you hear about us?” from the first sign-up.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Review monthly and test one change at a time.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:24.600
You define your communications measures and review routine.

7
00:00:24.600 --> 00:00:28.600
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

8
00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:33.200
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
